WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.358
Halcyon is Wallace Shift’s architectural roofing concept.

2
00:00:03.618 --> 00:00:08.080
A cinematic estate view introduces a premium, material-led experience.

3
00:00:08.721 --> 00:00:13.778
A detailed gallery brings the materials, their character, and their planning information together.

4
00:00:14.388 --> 00:00:18.935
The visualizer accepts a photograph, then offers material and finish choices.

5
00:00:19.195 --> 00:00:22.126
A new generation requires permission to send the image.

6
00:00:22.763 --> 00:00:24.656
Here we use prepared sample studies.

7
00:00:24.656 --> 00:00:29.808
Switch from metal to slate, then compare the result with the original home.

8
00:00:30.722 --> 00:00:34.100
Enter a roof area to explore an illustrative planning range.

9
00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:36.870
The photograph itself does not measure the roof.

10
00:00:37.513 --> 00:00:42.930
Those material and budget choices carry into a consultation brief, alongside the project and timeline.

11
00:00:43.555 --> 00:00:45.001
Review the resulting preview.

12
00:00:45.261 --> 00:00:48.844
Nothing is sent, stored, or booked in this demonstration.

13
00:00:49.472 --> 00:00:55.742
A premium website connecting visual inspiration with a more specific project conversation, by Wallace Shift.
